# Cloudflare Pages handles clean URLs automatically:
#   /about.html  ->  /about
#   /index.html  ->  /
# Do NOT add rules mapping /about back to /about.html — that creates an
# infinite redirect loop and takes the page offline.
#
# The apex -> www canonical behaviour is handled at the DNS / Cloudflare
# level, not here. Cloudflare Pages only accepts relative URLs as redirect
# sources, so absolute-URL rules are rejected at build time.
#
# This file is intentionally empty of rules.
